📗
  /todos — the Nest-style controller.

    GET    /todos           list (optional ?done=true|false)
    GET    /todos/:id       one todo or 404
    POST   /todos           {"title": "..."} → 201
    PUT    /todos/:id       {"title"?: "...", "done"?: bool}
    DELETE /todos/:id       204 or 404
